# ── 데이터베이스 ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# 운영: Neon (Vercel 연동). pooled URL은 앱, direct URL은 마이그레이션용.
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xxx-pooler.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xxx.ap-southeast-1.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require"
# 로컬: .env.local 에 아래처럼 두면 .env 보다 우선한다 (scripts/load-env.ts).
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://sulki:sulki@localhost:5434/sulki_holiday"
# DIRECT_URL="postgresql://sulki:sulki@localhost:5434/sulki_holiday"

# ── 인증 (Auth.js v5) ────────────────────────────────────────
# openssl rand -base64 32
AUTH_SECRET=""
AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true
AUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"

